cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "DeepMutate-3D: interactive protein language model mutation scanning on AlphaFold structures"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rashid
    family-names: Karim
    alias: Saadman
    email: rashidsaadman@gmail.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5179-5259"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Saadman/DeepMutate-3D"
url: "https://huggingface.co/spaces/ras1992/DeepMutate-3D"
abstract: >-
  DeepMutate-3D scores every possible single amino-acid substitution in a protein
  with the ESM-2 protein language model, using the log-likelihood ratio of
  mutant to wildtype residue, and paints the resulting per-residue sensitivity
  scores onto the protein's AlphaFold-predicted structure as an interactive 3D
  heatmap.
keywords:
  - protein language model
  - ESM-2
  - AlphaFold
  - variant effect prediction
  - deep mutational scanning
  - structural bioinformatics
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-09-07"
